      "cooked": "<p>Now that oversize villain cards are canon, how are future mini expansion villains going to be distributed? It will be tough packing a regular sized deck with oversized character cards into a compact shrink wrapped packing like those currently in use.</p><p>Or will future mini expansion villains use regular sized character cards and hence be 'non-canon'?</p>",
