      "id": 95192,
      "name": "e.hananto",
      "username": "e.hananto",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/e.hananto/{size}/2579_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-09T08:06:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Odin\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/odin/48/2572_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Odin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes!!! I was worried when I saw that there were no regular size character cards for the vengeance villains.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>i know right, I put all cards from all sets into a single dominion box with the EE box inside so that it forms 3 columns of cards. For now all cards and tokens fit into that one box.</p>\n<p>Of course the only problem now is that there is no way to store that oversized villain cards inside so the only thing I can do is leave it out… Damn my OCD bothers me more than it should knowing that I'm missing five vengeance cards not in the box &gt;&lt;</p>",
